            "text": "Full Interactive Loop — State Feedback + 3-TOP Chain\n\nPanelTOP's CHOP output (port 1) feeds back into LabelUI,\nshowing slider/knob values in real time. The panel texture\npasses through Transform → Composite → Crop — three spatial\nTOPs in sequence. All widgets stay interactive because each\nTOP accumulates its inverse transform on panel_sources.\n\nDrag the slider and knob: the label updates live,\nand clicks work through the transformed+cropped output.",
